<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ugh... It's so cold..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Sorry. It's something I can't talk about in front of everyone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Right at the start of the New Year, the secret base with <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... At any other time, the grown-ups would find us more easily."</STYLE><PG>
"So, what did you want to talk about?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... aren't </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> scared?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Scared?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... This year too, surely one person..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, that... Yeah, sure I'm scared. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I'm strong! Whoever the culprit is, I'll beat them!
{PAUSE ""}
　I've decided that once I know who the culprit is, I'll punish them with my own hands!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Even if it's... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">, listen. The culprit has to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... So..."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Why would you say something like that!? There's no way <STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE>'s the culprit!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">, I understand how you feel. I don't want to think </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s the culprit either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But no matter how I look at it―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, do you want me to kill <STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'll never forgive the culprit! I won't forgive whoever killed <STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
　That's why I've decided I'm going to kill the culprit myself!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">, calm down!</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">　Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has to be stopped, or sooner or later everyone will be killed!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, you know how I <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="さば">handle</STYLE> a knife, don't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I may still be a kid, but I'm stronger than anyone in this settlement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wait...!"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, if you keep trying to make me kill <STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE> like that, I'll kill <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> right now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I said wait...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, weren't you the one who started the curse-killings by <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="そそのか">leading</STYLE> everyone astray like that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If you don't tell the truth, I really will cut you!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Curse-killing is when people fall into paranoia like this and kill each other...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Paranoia?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's when you can't trust anyone anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> killed me now, it would mean </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> started a curse-killing."</STYLE><PG>
"This isn't a curse-killing. 
{PAUSE ""}
'Cause curse-killings happen in April."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All right. Kill me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ngh...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">'re still too soft. The moment your heart wavers even a little, the tables turn in an instant."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Stop it...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">, if you say you'll kill me, then I'll have to kill </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Listen, </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">. I don't want anyone to die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hyah!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学横顔怖い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I-I don't believe <STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE>'s the culprit! <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, you liar!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
